Open the toolbar. Turn a page. Explore the details.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:11.445
Search a format. Find your next document.

00:00:11.445 --> 00:00:14.364
Hide the sidebar. Make room for reading.

00:00:14.364 --> 00:00:17.883
Explore spreadsheets and worksheets

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:21.281
